ECT):**\n   - Added `## The Fuel Cans the depot holds (the story's positions table and AC-8: five of the Map's nine).` and `const DEPOT_CANS: int = 5`.\n   - In _try_depot, `_kit.need(problems, not cans.is_empty(), \"the Map has no Fuel Can under a Depot node\")` -> `_kit.need(problems, cans.size() == DEPOT_CANS, \"the depot holds %d Fuel Cans, not %d\" % [cans.size(), DEPOT_CANS])`.\n   - Its doc now says the depot must hold DEPOT_CANS Fuel Cans.\n   - On a scratch copy the unchanged control run passes; with FuelCanDepot3 removed, cover_stops fails with \"the depot holds 4 Fuel Cans, not 5\" and rc=1.\n\n**Checks run:** import (no class or .uid changes), parse, launch, the five new scenarios (map_cover twice, identical), regress, frozen and assets all passed. lint007 reports 0 over-long functions, 0 undocumented declarations and 0 doc lines over 100 columns.\n\n**For TD-006:** map_kit.gd is now 327 lines and map_cover.gd 303, up from the 319 and 301 the rulings named; the added lines are the docs the issues asked for and the new constant.\n\n**Not acted on:** unit.gd mentions a \"preflight probe\" at lines 97, 135 and 145. Those lines predate this story (they are in HEAD) and are outside these issues.", "complete": true}
